sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent
  participant S as SPIRE<br/>(workload identity issuer)
  participant B as Token broker<br/>(Authorization Server)
  participant M as MCP server

  A->>S: Request workload identity
  S-->>A: JWT-SVID
  A->>B: POST /token<br/>grant_type=token-exchange<br/>subject_token = JWT-SVID<br/>resource = mcp://example
  B-->>A: MCP-scoped access token<br/>sub = agent identity<br/>act.sub = user identity (when delegated)
  A->>M: Tool call + access token
  M-->>A: Tool response
